      "sentence_id": 1,
      "japanese": "「おかあさん、来てー！早く！！」娘は６歳だ。",
      "english_translation": "\"Mom, I'm here! Hurry up!\" The daughter is six years old."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 2,
      "japanese": "トイレでうんちをしておしりをふくときに、私を呼ぶ。",
      "english_translation": "Please call me when you need help cleaning up after yourself in the bathroom."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 3,
      "japanese": "それはいつものことなのだけれど、今日はいつもと違う。",
      "english_translation": "That's normal, but today is different."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "japanese": "怖いものでも見たような、助けを求めるような声で私を呼んでいるのだ。",
      "english_translation": "They're calling my name, with voices that sound just like those I've heard in nightmares, pleading for help."
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "japanese": "私が急いでトイレに行くと、娘が泣きそうな顔で、「うんちが、ね、うんちがプラプラする！」と、言う。",
      "english_translation": "As I rushed to the bathroom, my daughter looked at me with a distressed expression and said, \"My poop is... it's sloshing around!\""
    }
  ],
